        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we believe we are well-positioned to be designed into their current products and to continue developing next-generation AI platforms and low-power products for their future products.",
        "start_character": 15169,
        "end_character": 15364
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since our founding, we have partnered with a leading semiconductor foundry, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited (TSMC), for our SoC products in 180-nanometer, 90-nanometer, 40-nanometer, 22-nanometer, and 12-nanometer process nodes.",
        "start_character": 10912,
        "end_character": 11159
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Specifically, we have developed wide-ranging chip architectures, intellectual property (IP) building blocks, and integrated circuit (IC) design methodologies for digital circuits, analog circuits, and embedded memories – accumulating significant expertise and IP related to product design, validation, and production testing.",
        "start_character": 5211,
        "end_character": 5536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Third, we are establishing an IP licensing variant of SPOT to extend our technology beyond internally developed products, diversify revenue streams, and position SPOT as a scalable platform across the semiconductor ecosystem.",
        "start_character": 12291,
        "end_character": 12516
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are working to increase our software suite to include new AI software products, such as AI development kits, AI compilers and runtimes, and AI model development utilities.",
        "start_character": 14161,
        "end_character": 14335
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we are competitive with respect to these factors, particularly because our SPOT platform is designed to enable our products to have significantly lower power consumption than alternative products, allowing for greater adoption of AI at the edge.",
        "start_character": 36597,
        "end_character": 36858
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue to invest in research and development to support and enhance our existing low-power sub-threshold solutions and design and develop future product offerings.",
        "start_character": 22948,
        "end_character": 23126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to develop new ultra-lower power chip product families that we believe will provide us access to additional sockets within current customers, as well as to entirely new customers in new market segments.",
        "start_character": 13833,
        "end_character": 14045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a fabless business model and use third-party foundries, packaging, and testing contractors to manufacture, assemble, and test our semiconductor products.",
        "start_character": 18967,
        "end_character": 19131
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We use various generations of semiconductor processes to develop and manufacture our products.",
        "start_character": 20030,
        "end_character": 20124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We work closely with leading brands as well as OEM and original design manufacturers (ODM) throughout their design cycles, allowing us to develop long-term relationships with them as our technology becomes embedded in their products.",
        "start_character": 14935,
        "end_character": 15168
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-094004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-094004-f888bd3ac2032310",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-094004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our SPOT platform, we are able to manufacture our products at much more cost-effective process technology nodes.",
